.Dd October 18, 2026
.Dt TRANSCRIBE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm transcribe
.Nd transcribe audio with Whisper on OVHcloud AI Endpoints
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl dnqtw
.Op Fl f Ar format
.Op Fl l Ar lang
.Op Fl m Ar model
.Op Fl o Ar file
.Op Fl p Ar prompt
.Ar file ...
.Nm
.Op Fl t | Fl m Ar model
.Fl M
.Nm
.Fl h
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
sends each audio
.Ar file
to the Whisper models of OVHcloud AI Endpoints and prints its
transcript on stdout, one file after the other.
.Pp
Before each request it announces on stderr the file, the length of its
audio and what the request will cost, which is known in advance:
Whisper is billed per second of audio.
The rates are those of the OVHcloud catalogue, 0.00004083 EUR a second
for
.Ql whisper-large-v3 ,
the default, and 0.00001278 EUR for
.Ql whisper-large-v3-turbo .
A model named with
.Fl m
has no known rate, and its cost is left out; so is the length, when
.Xr ffprobe 1
is not installed or cannot measure the file.
.Pp
Whisper resamples its input to 16 kHz mono, so
.Nm
does the same before the upload, with
.Xr ffmpeg 1
when it is installed, which loses no accuracy and makes the upload
smaller; without ffmpeg, or with
.Fl n ,
the file is sent as it is.
Either way the file is staged in a temporary directory first, so that
an odd character in its name never reaches curl's form parsing.
.Ss Credentials
The API token is the first found of:
.Bl -enum -compact
.It
.Ev OVH_AI_TOKEN ;
.It
.Ev OVH_AI_ENDPOINTS_API_KEY ,
the name OVHcloud's own documentation uses;
.It
the first line of the file
.Ev OVH_AI_TOKEN_FILE ;
.It
the password of the first
.Ev OVH_AI_AUTHINFO_HOST
entry in
.Pa ~/.authinfo ,
then in
.Pa ~/.netrc ,
where lines starting with
.Ql #
are skipped and a trailing backslash joins a line to the next;
.It
the
.Ql api_key
of the client named
.Ql OVH
in the
.Xr aichat 1
configuration
.Ev AICHAT_CONFIG .
.El
.Pp
One token serves every AI Endpoints model.
It is handed to
.Xr curl 1
in a configuration file inside the temporary directory, readable by its
owner alone, rather than on curl's command line, where
.Xr ps 1
would show it to every user.
A token holding a character outside a bearer token's alphabet
.Pq RFC 6750: letters, digits and Ql ._~+/=-
is refused rather than escaped.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "-f format"
.It Fl d
Diarize: label the turns of each speaker.
This implies
.Fl f Ar verbose_json .
.It Fl f Ar format
The transcript's format:
.Ql text ,
the default,
.Ql json ,
.Ql verbose_json ,
.Ql srt
or
.Ql vtt .
.It Fl h
Print the usage, with where the credentials are read from, and exit.
.It Fl l Ar lang
The language spoken, as an ISO 639-1 code such as
.Ql en
or
.Ql fr ,
a hint to the model.
.It Fl M
Print the model the other options select, and exit, without reading
any file: for a caller recording how a transcript was made, without
knowing the defaults.
.It Fl m Ar model
The model, by name.
.It Fl n
Upload the file as it is, without resampling it.
.It Fl o Ar file
Write the transcript to
.Ar file
instead of stdout.
It takes one input only.
The transcript is written to
.Ar file
only once the request has succeeded, so a failed run leaves an earlier
transcript as it was.
.It Fl p Ar prompt
Bias the decoder towards names, jargon and spellings, given as one or
two natural sentences.
Whisper keeps only the last 224 tokens of a prompt, and a long or
repetitive one can be echoed back in place of the transcript, so a
prompt over 900 characters is refused.
A prompt given is announced on stderr, since its words can appear in
the transcript even when nobody said them.
.It Fl q
Quiet: announce neither the length and cost nor the prompt.
.It Fl t
Turbo: use
.Ql whisper-large-v3-turbo ,
roughly three times cheaper and faster, but prone to hallucinating on
silence.
.It Fl w
Word-level timestamps.
This implies
.Fl f Ar verbose_json .
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width OVH_AI_ENDPOINTS_API_KEY
.It Ev AICHAT_CONFIG
The aichat configuration a token may be read from; by default
.Pa ~/.config/aichat/config.yaml .
.It Ev OVH_AI_AUTHINFO_HOST
The machine whose password is the token in
.Pa ~/.authinfo
and
.Pa ~/.netrc ;
by default
.Ql oai.$OVH_AI_ENDPOINTS_DOMAIN .
.It Ev OVH_AI_ENDPOINT
The OpenAI-compatible API the request goes to; by default
.Ql https://oai.$OVH_AI_ENDPOINTS_DOMAIN/v1 .
.It Ev OVH_AI_ENDPOINTS_API_KEY
The API token, when
.Ev OVH_AI_TOKEN
is not set.
.It Ev OVH_AI_ENDPOINTS_DOMAIN
The domain of AI Endpoints; by default
.Ql endpoints.kepler.ai.cloud.ovh.net .
.It Ev OVH_AI_TOKEN
The API token.
.It Ev OVH_AI_TOKEN_FILE
A file whose first line is the token; by default
.Pa ~/.config/ovhcloud/ai-token .
.It Ev TMPDIR
Where the temporary directory is made, instead of
.Pa /tmp .
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa ~/.config/ovhcloud/ai-token
The token, on its first line.
.It Pa ~/.authinfo , Pa ~/.netrc
The token, as the password of the AI Endpoints host.
.It Pa ~/.config/aichat/config.yaml
The token, as the
.Ql api_key
of the client named
.Ql OVH .
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
Every file was transcribed.
.It 1
A failure: no token, a file that cannot be read, curl or ffmpeg
failing, or an HTTP error from the API, whose answer is shown on
stderr.
.It 2
A usage error: an unknown format, a prompt over 900 characters, or
.Fl o
with more than one file.
.It 130
Interrupted.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
An interview in French, its names spelled right:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ transcribe -l fr -p "Entretien avec Mme Duval, \(`a Lyon." interview.m4a
.Ed
.Pp
Word-level timestamps into a file:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ transcribe -w -o talk.json talk.wav
.Ed
.Pp
The model a script's transcripts were made with:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ transcribe -t -M
whisper-large-v3-turbo
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr curl 1 ,
.Xr ffmpeg 1 ,
.Xr ffprobe 1 ,
.Xr vocalise 1
.Sh CAVEATS
.Fl f Ar srt
and
.Fl f Ar vtt
are refused by the API today, with HTTP 400, though it advertises
them.
.Pp
.Nm
needs
.Xr curl 1 :
.Xr fetch 1 ,
which
.Fx
has in its base system, cannot upload a multipart form.
